# The cutover arms the shards of the layout recorded when the build began,
# missing those a reshard added since (#4250).
MODULE: RedirectsCoverSourceArmsInheritedLayout
TARGET: RedirectsCoverSource
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the cutover arms the layout the destination inherited
PERTURBS: CutArm

--- FIND
    /\ armed' = armed \cup {<<srcPhys, s, dest>> : s \in shards[srcPhys]}
--- REPLACE
    /\ armed' = armed \cup {<<srcPhys, s, dest>> : s \in inherited}
--- END
